      "writtenOn": "2022-02-22T09:18:05Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e On a given SOC, you cannot have more redistributors than the number of CPUs, when ALL CPUS are functional\n\nThat is not accurate for Tegra. We have a production level full configuration where there are more GICR frames than CPUs. Now adding non-existent CPUs to the mix by saying that they are present will be inaccurate. I want to avoid that situation when we have a very straight forward solution in this patch series.",
